          <zeebe:input source="= &quot;&lt;html>&lt;p>Hi  &quot; + Current Vacation Status.name + &quot;,&lt;/p> &lt;p> &lt;/p> &lt;p>Your vacation request from &quot; + From + &quot; to &quot; + To + &quot; was approved.&lt;/p> &lt;p> &lt;/p> &lt;p>Best regards&lt;/p> &lt;p> &lt;/p> &lt;p>This is an automated message generated by the vacation system.&lt;/p>&lt;/html>&quot;" target="mailBody"/>
